@baseUrl = http://192.168.1.61:8000/api-d/v1

### Get all first responders within 100 km of a location (grouped by type, sorted closest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/first-responders/?lat=30.514462&lng=-60.65113
Accept: application/json

### Get first responders within 100 km filtered to a single type
GET {{baseUrl}}/first-responders/?lat=6.5244&lng=3.3792&type=abuseandviolence
Accept: application/json

### Get all first responders filtered to a single type (no geo filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/first-responders/?type=abuseandviolence
Accept: application/json

### Search by keyword only (sorted by relevance)
GET {{baseUrl}}/first-responders/?search=police
Accept: application/json

### Search by keyword + geo (sorted by relevance first, then distance)
GET {{baseUrl}}/first-responders/?search=hospital&lat=4.8956857&lng=6.9751075
Accept: application/json

### Search by keyword + geo + type filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/first-responders/?search=flood&lat=4.8948&lng=6.9719&type=accidentsanddisaster
Accept: application/json
